Package: microplotr
Title: Literature-Grounded Microbial Ecology Plots From Tidy Input
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Luigi", "Gallucci", email = "luigigallucci8@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Literature-grounded, publication-ready plots for marker-gene
    (e.g. 16S) microbiome data, functional profiles (eggNOG-mapper/
    KofamScan-shaped), and metagenomics (MAG quality, assembly QC) from
    plain tidy input, built on ggplot2. Includes an upload-time validator
    that reports exactly what is wrong with the input data, and a Shiny
    app for interactive use.
